{"unit_id":"JeremyWangCY__dsh-rea#caveat-1","repo":"JeremyWangCY/dsh-rea","commit":"eeff7f8a04645631c043bb9f5e6a764850f416c3","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-rea 将 REA 作为本地 stdio 子进程连接，断线后不会自动重连；重启连接可能丢失当前目标及保留的证据状态，需显式重载插件。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:68-85"]}
